   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Emphasising a person or thing",
     "texto": [
      "With **det var … der** (or **som**) a part of the sentence is emphasised: **Det var Lars, der ringede.** = It was Lars who called.",
      "The same for a thing: **Det var bogen, jeg købte.** = It was the book that I bought."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Der or som",
     "texto": [
      "When the emphasised element is the subject, both **der** and **som** are possible: **Det var Lars, der/som ringede.** If it's the object, **som** is usually used, and it can be left out: **Det var bogen, (som) jeg købte.** With time or place, the marker can also be left out: **Det var i går, vi mødtes.** = It was yesterday that we met."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
